From 9c3cf71836a4c867ef2f6106e148c5b45f08c851 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GCSA-aegis <aegis@gcsa.local>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 05:16:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Aegis: uncloak CNAME tracker aliases and clear bounce-tracker
 cookies

Block first-party subresources whose DNS CNAME chain points at a known
tracker, and immediately delete cookies on BTM bounce hops that match
Aegis tracker rules instead of waiting for the default grace period.
